You can configure editor-wide Ruff options by adding the following to your `settings.json` under `lsp.ruff.initialization_options.settings`:

```json
{
  "lsp": {
    "ruff": {
      "initialization_options": {
        "settings": {
          "lineLength": 80,
          "lint": {
            "extendSelect": ["I"]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

