To map local path and Git dependencies from your `requirements.in` to `[tool.uv.sources]` in `pyproject.toml`, structure it like this:

```toml
[project]
dependencies = [
    "path-dep",
    "editable-path-dep",
    "git-dep",
]

[tool.uv.sources]
path-dep = { path = "./path-dep" }
editable-path-dep = { path = "./editable-path-dep", editable = true }
git-dep = { git = "https://github.com/astral-sh/git-dep" }
```

